<title>UK: UK meals/feeds little changed and quiet.</title>
<headline>UK meals/feeds little changed and quiet.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK meals and feeds prices were little changed on Wednesday in quiet trade.</p>
<p>Ex-mill high protein soymeal sellers were around one stg down while store were unchanged.</p>
<p>&quot;Nearby soymeal remains tight and there is some shipper interest, but no one is willing to give any details at the moment,&quot; said a trader.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
</text>
